{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49927","headline":"沁园春 三 · 吕岩","name":"沁园春 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"诗曲文章，任汝空留，数千万篇。\n奈日推一日，月推一月。\n今年不了，又待来年。\n有限光阴，无涯火院，只恐蹉跎老却贤。\n贪痴汉，望成家学道，两事双全。\n凡间，只恋尘缘，又谁信壶中别有天。\n这道本无情，不亲富贵。\n不疎贫贱，只要心坚。\n不在劳神，不须苦行，息虑忘机合自然。\n长生事，待明公放下，方可相传。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49927.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49927","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}